ss=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/2ee78a6329d1fc356768c9f7b0da9d2d.poster.avif?t=1755199148\" width=800 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/2ee78a6329d1fc356768c9f7b0da9d2d.webm?t=1755199148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/2ee78a6329d1fc356768c9f7b0da9d2d.mp4?t=1755199148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique puzzle-combat system</strong> built around momentum-based movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple weapons to unlock</strong>, each with a specific puzzle mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An atmospheric Venetian setting</strong>, blending historical beauty with eerie fantasy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nonlinear Metroidvania exploration</strong>\u2014discover new abilities to open fresh paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging and devious boss fights</strong>, where strategy is key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fast-paced movement system</strong> designed with speedrunning in mind.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Sliding Hero is a top-down puzzle Metroidvania where movement is key\u2014think carefully, as once you start sliding you won\u2019t stop until you hit something! Imprisoned in a sinister 1700s Venetian villa, explore a world of Carnival mystery, solve devious puzzles, uncover secrets, and unmask your fate.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Italian, French, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cSliding Hero turns a contentious puzzle type into an otherworldly jaunt through a cursed Venetian carnival\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>\u201cI was pleasantly surprised by it, and I'm still thinking about its weird, eyeball-infested gardens even now.\u201d<br>Eurogamer<br>",
